msgid "An initiative by"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "index_intro.other"
msgid ""
"We make licensing easy for humans and machines alike. We solve a fundamental "
"issue that Free Software licensing has at the very source: what license is a "
"file licensed under, and who owns the copyright? **Adopting our "
"recommendations is as easy as one-two-three**!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "index_step1.other"
msgid "Choose and provide licenses"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "index_step2.other"
msgid "Add copyright and licensing information to each file"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "index_step3.other"
msgid "Confirm REUSE compliance"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "index_rationale.other"
msgid ""
"Copyright and licensing is difficult, especially when reusing software from "
"different projects that are released under various different licenses. REUSE "
"was started by the [Free Software Foundation Europe](https://fsfe.org) "
"(FSFE) to provide a set of recommendations to make licensing your Free "
"Software projects **easy, comprehensive, unambiguous, and machine-readable**."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "index_dev_head.other"
msgid "For developers"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "index_dev_text.other"
msgid ""
"The license of your project sets the terms under which others can reuse your "
"software. That is why you should make sure that it is clear for everyone "
"which parts of your software are under which license. REUSE safeguards your "
"intentions and assists you in this process. Have a look at our [tools "
"section](dev/) to learn about the tool, inclusion in CI/CD processes, and "
"more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "index_reuse_head.other"
msgid "Reusing made simple"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "index_reuse_text.other"
msgid ""
"Free Software enables you to build on top of the work of others and "
"therefore innovate quickly. But the more external components you use, the "
"harder it is to keep an overview of copyright holders and their licensing "
"choices. With REUSE, each file holds the necessary information, and your "
"repo transparently contains all used licenses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "index_legal_head.other"
msgid "License compliance"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "index_legal_text.other"
msgid ""
"There are many tools that aid you in license compliance for software, many "
"using databases and fuzzy heuristics. A REUSE-compliant project makes the "
"jobs of legal experts and compliance officers much easier. Creating a bill "
"of materials can be achieved with just one simple command. REUSE [does not "
"replace other tools](comparison/), it is a long-awaited addition."
msgstr ""

